{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Dil ki awaj bhi sun,        [A#]mere fasaane pe na [D#]ja
Meri naj [F]ro ki taraf dekh,        zama [A#]ne pe na ja
[A#]Ek nazar dekh leeeeeee,        [A#]Ek nazar dekh le
[A#]jeene ki ijaajt de [F]de,        Ruthhane [G#]waale wo
[F]pahali si moha [A#]bbat de de,        [A#]Ishk maasum hai
Ilzaam lagaane pe na [D#]ja,        Meri naz [F]ro ki taraf dekh
zama [A#]ne pe n ja,        [A#]Wakt insaan pe
[A#]aisa bhi kabhi ata [F]hai,        Raah mein [G#]chhod ke
[F]saaya bhi chala [A#]jaata hai,        [A#]Din bhi nikalega kabhi,
Raat ke ane pe na [D#]ja,        Meri naz [F]ro ki taraf dekh
zama [A#]ne pe n ja,        [A#]Main hakikat hun,
Ye ek roj dikhaaunga [D#]tujhe,        Begunaa [G#]hi pe moha [F]bbat ki
rulaa [A#]unga tujhe,        [A#]Daag dil ke nahin mitate hain,
mitaane pe na [D#]ja,        Meri naz [F]ro ki taraf dekh
zama [A#]ne pe n ja
